1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
钙钛矿配方闭环优化
(Closed-loop formulation optimization)

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,500
贝叶斯优化
(Bayesian optimization)

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,500
导入九组分配方与实测 PCE
(Import nine-component formulations and measured PCE)

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,500
设置优化参数，生成下一批候选配方
(Set optimization parameters and generate the next batch)

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,500
导出推荐配方，开展高通量实验
(Export recommended formulations for high-throughput experiments)

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,000
高通量实验与表征
(High-throughput experimentation and characterization)

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:32,300
高通量薄膜制备
(High-throughput film fabrication)

8
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:41,300
高通量光学表征
(High-throughput optical characterization)

9
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,800
预训练模型预测
(Pretrained-model prediction)

10
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:46,800
读取吸收与双面激发光致发光光谱
(Load absorption and photoluminescence spectra)

11
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:50,800
预测器件效率，并按预测 PCE 排序
(Predict device PCE and rank the samples)

12
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,300
器件验证与反馈
(Device validation and feedback)

13
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:57,067
高通量热蒸镀
(High-throughput thermal evaporation)

14
00:00:57,067 --> 00:00:58,200
批量制备的器件阵列
(Arrays of fabricated devices)

15
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:03,300
高通量光电表征
(High-throughput optoelectronic characterization)

16
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:07,300
读取对应器件 PCE，记录实验反馈
(Read device PCE and record experimental feedback)

17
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,300
贝叶斯优化 → 实验与表征 → 模型预测 → 验证与反馈
(Optimize → Experiment → Predict → Validate & update)
